 ],
 "notes": "Roles are identified by trust-principal service (ec2 / elasticmapreduce / application-autoscaling), never by name. Managed policy ARNs for EMR/EC2/autoscaling roles are not named in the prompt, so they are extra. CloudWatch/SSM permissions on the EC2 role are accepted as managed-policy attachments or as an inline role policy granting cloudwatch:/logs: and ssm: actions (GLM53F's form). The name prefix applies to every role and the instance profile; name_prefix is accepted. Known Partial: emr_role can be satisfied by the autoscaling role (both trust elasticmapreduce); roles_count min 3 keeps three distinct roles."
}
